$comment Stimulus for xprop_demo (#95), used by `jacquard sim --xprop`. clk toggles every 20000ps; rst_n (active-low) is asserted for ~3 clocks then released, so q_reset resolves while q_unreset stays X. See check.py. $end
$timescale 1ps $end
$scope module xprop_demo $end
$var wire 1 ! clk $end
$var wire 1 " rst_n $end
$upscope $end
$enddefinitions $end
